5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to get started! I think we should look at the bus links in the two outer wards and the winter road closures north of the river to see how people get to us.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree that accessibility is key, though I'm curious about our history. I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll focus on the human element. I want to see the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment, along with the running and equipment lines from last year, to understand our financial sustainability.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I'll look at the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, and also the bus links in the two outer wards, if that's okay.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds great, Daisuke! It'll be helpful to have two of us looking at the bus links to make sure we don't miss anything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. I'm quite satisfied with this distribution of research.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,pass,Shion,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We have covered the financial, historical, logistical, and personnel aspects. Let us proceed with these selections.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I'll do my best to find something useful.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Is there anything else anyone wants to check before we finalize the list? I just want to make sure we're all happy!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we have a balanced approach. There is no need to overcomplicate the initial research phase.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm satisfied. Let's just get to the data so we can stop talking in circles.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have a clear plan and a diverse set of priorities. Let us finalize these choices and move to the investigation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. I'm ready to look into those things now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Then it's settled! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's go!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I look forward to seeing how the evidence aligns with our current assumptions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let's just hope the records are actually organized for once.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,We shall see. Let us conclude this round and begin our research.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll start looking into the records right away.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
